{
  "description": "Authorization server metadata (/.well-known/lws-configuration), metadata URL derivation (RFC 8414 section 3.1), token responses, protected resource metadata (RFC 9728) with the origin and resource comparisons of the discovery checks (lws10-core 'Discovery Validation by a Client'), and the realm containment checks of the challenge of the drafts before 19 October 2026.",
  "metadata": {
